Each piece is 6 inches, which is 0.5 feet. We divide 4 feet by 0.5 feet per piece:

$$
\frac{4 \, \text{feet}}{0.5 \, \text{feet/piece}} = 8 \, \text{pieces}
$$

Both methods yield the same result.

---

**Final Answer:**  
$$
\boxed{8}
$$

This confirms that Tracy obtained 8 pieces of wire.  
