Each piece of wire is 6 inches long. To determine how many pieces can be obtained, divide the total length by the length of each piece:
$$
\frac{48 \text{ inches}}{6 \text{ inches per piece}} = 8
$$

---

### Final Answer:
$$
\boxed{8}
$$

