# Total stickers after buying and birthday
total_stickers = initial_stickers + bought_stickers + birthday_stickers

# Stickers given to sister
given_to_sister = 9

# Stickers used for greeting card
used_for_card = 28

# Calculate remaining stickers
remaining_stickers = total_stickers - given_to_sister - used_for_card

print(remaining_stickers)
```

