Amy is older than Jackson by 5. Then Amy is younger than Corey by 2. So Corey is older than Amy by 2. So Corey is older than Jackson by 5 + 2 = 7. So Corey is Jackson's age +7. And since Corey is 11, Jackson is 4. Yep. All the numbers add up. 

